<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\mike_noise.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\美冬車.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The time had gone past 17:00.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A light car was parked beside the apartment building where the Kogori and Niimura families lived―Revo Heights.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬横顔.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
In the driver's seat was <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She</STYLE> was wearing earphones connected to a brand-new smartphone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The sounds of the Niimura home―were coming to her through the bugged smartphone of <STYLE ID="2">Haruka Niimura</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Almost time..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\注射器.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "C" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
On the passenger seat lay a syringe filled with a pink drug. <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE> picked it up.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Whew..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE> took a shallow deep breath.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That sigh just now had not been nerves.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She had gone over once more, in her head, what she had to do next.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It happened just as <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE> was about to stick the needle into her arm.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\倒れる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Who is this!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Run! It's the shinigami!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Senpai! Help me!"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "in_dream低.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\hit_axe1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\hit_axe1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\hit_axe1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
Dying screams, and the sounds of flesh being cut and bones being crushed.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What's going on...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "SE" "2000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE> flung the syringe onto the passenger seat before it went in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then she put on the red robes and the Noh mask, and took up the nata and the mace.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Taking the stairs so as not to be seen, she came to stand in front of the Niimura apartment.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It would be bad to be spotted, so this time <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE> took no deep breath and opened the door quickly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
From inside, she could sense neither sound nor presence.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The smell of blood...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Earlier she had concentrated on her hearing, but this time she relied on her sense of smell to search out the state of the room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even had she tried to rely on her eyes, it was dim inside.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\ドッキリ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
A movie was playing without sound on the room's TV, and thick curtains were drawn over the windows.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And on the floor lay the brutally murdered bodies of the girls.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Their clothes and white skin were stained with blood, and they lay in cramped positions clearly unlike sleep.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\能面横顔右.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Who on earth..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She had used her hearing, used her sense of smell, and then used her sight, yet she could neither grasp nor understand what was happening.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did she mean to touch their skin next, and confirm the situation by touch?<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="5">"I have been waiting for you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Who!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without warning, a hoarse voice reached <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE>'s ears―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yet <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE> froze at that voice, one she knew.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She had said 'Who?' because she doubted who the voice belonged to.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "太古の暗い鳴動.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\大魔女能面大.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "$000080" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n50\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n50\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\ドッキリ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
When <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE> turned around, there stood one more shinigami, dressed just like her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unlike <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE>'s <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="こおもて">young woman's mask</STYLE>, this shinigami's was the Noh mask of an <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ろうじょ">old woman</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE> knew well what this Noh mask meant.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\大魔女能面横.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\能面横顔左.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... I have waited a very long time..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I knew it. That voice...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The voice was muffled by the Noh mask, but on hearing it <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE> stepped back one step, and then another.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\能面土下座.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Then she laid the nata and the mace on the floor, and put her knees and hands down on the bloodied floor.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"It has been a long time, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="おおまじょ">Grand Witch</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE>, still kneeling, gave a <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="うやうや">respectful</STYLE> greeting and went on speaking.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"For my absence, and that of </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">my daughter Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―from my </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">husband</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s memorial service, I offer my deepest </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="わ">apologies</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You have come all the way from </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="あらたしゅうらく">the Arata settlement</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But why? Why would </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... these girls..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE>, her head still lowered, asked the <STYLE ID="5">Grand Witch</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"One for all, all for one. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">It is the slogan of the Arata settlement; even elementary school children understand it. Have you forgotten?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, that is not so. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Grand Witch-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...! I do not recall asking </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="あらた">Arata</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to do anything like this! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="1">This is... a matter between me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Why? Why </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Ryoji Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But how is it that you know </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">his</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> name?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"About 20 years ago, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, for your wedding ceremony with </STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you said you wished to invite the Kogori couple to </STYLE><STYLE ID="17" RUBY="あらた">Arata</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, did you not? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　We could not permit an outsider to attend, but I remember the name. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Besides, </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">his</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> name is now famous all over Japan as that of a pitiful man who was horribly murdered."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That is true..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Lift your head, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\能面横顔左.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE> lifted her head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But her hands, resting on the floor, moved as if hesitating over doing something.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"What are you doing? When I tell you to lift your head, I am telling you to show me your face."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE> did as she was told, took off the mask, and set it on the floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... you are crying, are you not..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬土下座.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Because... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"I heard that in this town where </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> live, a brutally murdered body had turned up. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">The thirteenth-year memorial service, on April 8. How could I not know?" [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I am so very sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\大魔女能面バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
The <STYLE ID="5">Grand Witch</STYLE> turned her face toward the bodies lying on the floor.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Erina Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. And </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">my granddaughter Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">I did it in your place, but was this all right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE> fell silent.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\大魔女能面横.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス,000" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ベンチ殴る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="18">"Answer me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="19">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="18">."</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The <STYLE ID="5">Grand Witch</STYLE> shouted and struck the table with the mace, and <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE>'s body gave a jolt.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"A... at least... I never planned to kill E-</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Erina Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I see. Then that was a pitiful thing I did."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The <STYLE ID="5">Grand Witch</STYLE> stroked <STYLE ID="4">Erina Goto</STYLE>'s head <STYLE ID="20" RUBY="な">gently</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Why </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
