{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="21">"Ahem! Also, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="21">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="21">, I know this is all hard on you both, but I'd like to hear from you. Can you come with us?"</STYLE>
